    IF `the person has been bound by a recognizance to attend to give evidence in a proceeding` AND `the person does not attend or does not remain in attendance`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "If a person who has been bound by a recognizance to attend to give evidence in any proceeding does not attend or does not remain in attendance"

