    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The court, judge, justice or provincial court judge that endorses the warrant must include any conditions of the undertaking that the court, judge, justice or provincial court judge considers necessary to ensure that the person will appear and give evidence in the proceeding"

